  "@info:usagetip\u0004Look for a setting in <application>%1</application> to disable its tray icon before doing it here. Some apps’ tray icons were not designed to be disabled, and using this setting may cause them to behave unexpectedly.<nl/><nl/>Use this setting at your own risk, and do not report issues to KDE or the app’s author.": "请先在 <application>%1</application> 的设置中查找关闭托盘图标的选项。部分应用的托盘图标不支持禁用，在此关闭图标会导致应用出现异常。<nl/><nl/>使用此设置的风险由你自行承担，请勿向 KDE 或应用作者报告由此引起的问题。",
  "@info:usagetip\u0004Disabling the clipboard is not recommended, as it will cause copied data to be lost when the application it was copied from is closed.<nl/><nl/>Only do this if you’ve manually added a standalone Clipboard widget somewhere else, or are using a 3rd-party clipboard manager. Also, instead consider configuring the clipboard to not save history, or to only remember one item at a time.": "不建议禁用剪贴板。关闭复制数据的来源应用后，已复制的数据将丢失。<nl/><nl/>仅在其他位置添加了独立剪贴板小组件，或正在使用第三方剪贴板管理器时禁用此功能。你也可将剪贴板设为不保存历史记录，或仅保留一项记录。",
  "@info:usagetip\u0004Disabling the Notifications widget is not recommended, as notifications sent by apps will no longer be shown.<nl/><nl/>Only do this if you’ve manually added a standalone Notifications widget somewhere else, or are intentionally using a 3rd-party notification manager to handle notifications.": "不建议禁用通知小组件。禁用后，应用发送的通知将不再显示。<nl/><nl/>仅在其他位置添加了独立通知小组件，或使用第三方通知管理器处理通知时禁用此功能。"
